Changes made by Joshua Almeida in 2026 for 360 Bench
(https://github.com/fitzyracing1/360-bench), based on upstream commit d051625:
- action.yml: runtime changed from node12 to node24; name changed to
  "360 Bench Remove Labels" for the GitHub Marketplace. Inputs are unchanged.
- src/main.ts: Octokit calls moved to the `rest` namespace of
  @actions/github 9, and the caught error typed for TypeScript 5. Behaviour
  is unchanged.
- package.json, package-lock.json, tsconfig.json: dependencies updated to
  @actions/core 3 and @actions/github 9, built as an ES module with
  @vercel/ncc 0.45 on Node 24; yarn.lock replaced by package-lock.json;
  unused dependencies and the old eslint/jest setup removed.
- dist/: rebuilt. Licenses of the bundled third-party packages are listed
  in dist/licenses.txt.
- test/: new end-to-end tests against a fake GitHub API.
- README.md, NOTICE, .github/workflows/: rewritten for the fork.
